Ederede mgbe-ọbịara: ['html'] mee: { <- (
		onwe
		dochie: ['&'] na: ['&amp;'],
		dochie: ['<'] na: ['&lt;'],
		dochie: ['>'] na: ['&gt;'],
		dochie: ['"'] na: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Ndepụta ohuru.

['Verbatim Syntax'] mkpụrụedemede-niile nke-ọ-bụla: { :nọmba :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (nọmba), Letter: letter).
}.

Mpụta list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list jikọọ: ['↵']).

Mpụta dee: template.

